im]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-e7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-e7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restrict plan-header parsing to the leading block[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]header-block[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-block: stop the Rust plan-header parser from scanning the whole [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document body, so an ordinary known-label bullet no longer invalidates a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan; publish the fix in a core release, raise the Python floor to it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drop the plans-sidecar wording workaround.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make every prompt interface canonical[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]canonical-interfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical-interfaces: retire the export path that writes prompt Markdown[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the plans store, retarget prompt search at the canonical agents [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive, delete plans-snapshot discovery once nothing calls it, and add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the regression test that enforces the invariant.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make agent prompts migrate correct and durable[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]migrate-durability[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]migrate-durability: resolve the plans sidecar effective for the caller [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of the first existing clone, and make a write run either publish[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]both sidecars or fail with exact recovery instructions, with restart [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]states tested.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Correct the directory-map asset and the prompt docs[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-assets[dim] · [dim][/dim]after canonical-interfaces[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-assets: remove prompt snapshots from the plans directory-map [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source, regenerate its PNG, and bring the prompt documentation in line [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the canonical archive and the export decision.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close out sase-dh[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]closeout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after header-block, canonical-interfaces, migrate-durability,[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]docs-assets[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closeout: re-verify every gap against final source and remote state, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]disposition all proposed follow-ups, close the epic on evidence rather [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]than force, run post-close Symvision cleanup, and mark the linked plan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]done.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e7","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-e7.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-95a8f53000dbd51e6e5a54df5a76e969","started_at":"2026-08-02T13:30:19.332720+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"c45d91bcf2a1bb41240ca9fe3d8813366e27676ab347c41f85c5a64bbb17b434","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e7.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi20